        "text": "The Clean Air Act establishes a comprehensive venue framework for judicial review of EPA actions."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "EPA",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9ba92e34aa7a5df33e91702e1d18cdb675d83c827c65951dfa15d780c773e8fc",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9ba92e34aa7a-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "EPA argued that \u201cdisproportionate economic hardship\u201d applies only to hardship directly caused by renewable fuel program compliance, and that Renewable Identification Number (RIN) costs are fully passed through to consumers, creating a presumption against granting exemptions."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "EPA",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9ba92e34aa7a5df33e91702e1d18cdb675d83c827c65951dfa15d780c773e8fc",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9ba92e34aa7a-0000-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 9,
              "start": 9
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "EPA asserted that its denials are reviewable only in the D.C. Circuit."
      }
    ],
